-- 13.6.4  the leaf loop's seams: ftz priced apart from fma --
   k = 262144 x 8 passes = 2097152 multiply-accumulates per arm per repeat
   sink 3320444086 (printed so no arm is optimized away)
   fma cost = fma - plain. ftz cost = contract - fma, and ONLY in the IDENTICAL binary; under FAST the contract arm should collapse onto the plain arm and that collapse is the mode witness.

